{{History|1.5.3|Fixed summit cutscene not triggering in [[Multiplayer]] if a player was married to another player. Fixed summit cutscene being repeatable if its music wasn't marked as heard.}}
{{History|1.6|Added a new cutscene if the player enters illegitimately. Perfection cutscene now says "No Joja services used!" if the player did not use any Joja services.}}

